        "about": {
          "title": "Built on Trust & Comfort",
          "description": "Royal Continental Hotel Dubai (specifically in Deira City Centre) is a 4-star, modern property near Dubai International Airport and the Metro, known for being a clean, comfortable, and well-located choice for both business and leisure travelers. Key features include spacious rooms, a rooftop pool, a 24-hour halal restaurant, and a spa. ",
